{\"content\": \"限制性股票激励计划（公司版本）：用户自述回购价仅写“按公司届时确定的价格”（Notion 存档，非原件）。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"64734e9b-2bd6-41fa-8f7b-c0c2e7625b6b\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"4950184b-9187-487e-8dc3-4a8e3a27e10d\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"callout\", \"callout\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"未拿到两份原件前，不能断言“一定按收盘价”，也不能接受公司仅凭计划含糊表述单方定价；需核对“冲突以何者为准”条款。详见 legal_analysis.md 第一节。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"253a4cf6-8dab-422e-832c-3de33cc18588\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"4950184b-9187-487e-8dc3-4a8e3a27e10d\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_3\", \"heading_3\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"B. 民法典规则（条文 + 适用边界）\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"3d033ce4-d839-49e1-894a-fb8c2fac1da5\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"4950184b-9187-487e-8dc3-4a8e3a27e10d\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"art_cc_509 第五百零九条（按约全面履行 + 诚信）：若 8.3 条成立有效，公司应按基准日收盘价履行。前提：条款已成为合同内容且有效。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"f718ea1f-1030-4018-89dc-c898a0afef11\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"4950184b-9187-487e-8dc3-4a8e3a27e10d\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"art_cc_496 第四百九十六条（格式条款提示说明）：未就重大利害条款合理提示说明的，可主张该条款不成为合同内容。需先证明属格式条款且未提示。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"850db176-2be1-478c-8a67-6612221af01d\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"4950184b-9187-487e-8dc3-4a8e3a27e10d\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"art_cc_497 第四百九十七条（格式条款无效）：不合理免除/减轻公司责任、限制或排除员工主要权利的，无效。价格低本身不等于无效。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"3de70cba-4b6b-4402-842b-3c24ca09a0ee\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"4950184b-9187-487e-8dc3-4a8e3a27e10d\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"art_cc_151 第一百五十一条（显失公平可撤销）：需证明订立时利用危困/缺乏判断能力 + 结果显著失衡；单纯事后觉得价格不理想不够。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"a7e10973-60b8-4688-8cf7-33b6d61ca969\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"4950184b-9187-487e-8dc3-4a8e3a27e10d\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_3\", \"heading_3\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"C. 脱敏判例与裁判思路\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"2b496ca2-36fb-46b6-8e32-f7e8c8fa8eb2\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"4950184b-9187-487e-8dc3-4a8e3a27e10d\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"case_rsu_001（浦东，2025-10-23）：合同明确约定基准日市场价 → 按“已归属数量×基准日市场价”核对；工资与工龄不作股权估值基数。边界：以合同明确约定为前提，无此约定不能套用统一公式。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"c2d964cf-7f1f-4d55-8f16-17578983023c\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"4950184b-9187-487e-8dc3-4a8e3a27e10d\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"case_rsu_002（上海一中院，2025-11-26）：审查低价结算格式条款的提示说明义务；模板签字不当然等于已提示；市场价高于内部价也不当然使条款无效。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"00a1a5dc-f84f-44dd-88ff-f0fefd2824e3\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"4950184b-9187-487e-8dc3-4a8e3a27e10d\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"bulleted_list_item\", \"bulleted_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"case_rsu_003（闵行，2025-12-04）：限时签署+家庭压力不当然构成显失公平；看危困利用、信息披露、磋商过程与显著失衡。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"74307ac4-415f-4981-8d20-af4c4675c269\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"4950184b-9187-487e-8dc3-4a8e3a27e10d\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"callout\", \"callout\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"以上均为脱敏摘要，仅说明裁判思路，不具先例约束力。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"652803d1-a12d-4174-8ca3-a93feddde559\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"4950184b-9187-487e-8dc3-4a8e3a27e10d\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_3\", \"heading_3\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"D. 分层结论\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"74c4cab9-89ba-4027-8e09-417db06f592d\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"4950184b-9187-487e-8dc3-4a8e3a27e10d\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"最优：8.3 条成立有效且优先 → 5000 股 × 基准日收盘价，公司单方低价无依据。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"53e5353e-f9f9-4a97-8f8f-b93465898da2\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"4950184b-9187-487e-8dc3-4a8e3a27e10d\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"若计划条款优先：审查“公司届时定价”是否属未提示的格式条款（496）/是否无效（497）。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"5c2e59e6-cecd-47bf-815e-1ca8675e549c\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"4950184b-9187-487e-8dc3-4a8e3a27e10d\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"numbered_list_item\", \"numbered_list_item\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"若存在限时催签/捆绑：保留证据，作 151 显失公平综合依据，不预设撤销。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"4bb31809-a436-4bb9-87d7-e160dfb94b8b\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"4950184b-9187-487e-8dc3-4a8e3a27e10d\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"paragraph\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"不泛化：不存在“所有离职股权一律按收盘价”的统一规则；结论仅适用本合同文本与证据。\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"4ca3e5f2-902c-457c-8e0f-a4759bef0a50\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"4950184b-9187-487e-8dc3-4a8e3a27e10d\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"heading_3\", \"heading_3\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"E. 工资/工龄边界\"}}]}}, {\"object\": \"block\", \"id\": \"1dcac41b-4c01-45cd-88ae-eb9471485ba7\", \"parent\": {\"type\": \"page_id\", \"page_id\": \"4950184b-9187-487e-8dc3-4a8e3a27e10d\"}, \"created_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"last_edited_time\": \"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\", \"has_children\": false, \"archived\": false, \"in_trash\": false, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"paragraph\": {\"rich_text\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {\"content\": \"工资流水（月均 33,100）仅作收入/现金流旁证；工龄约 8 年仅用于劳动经济补偿 N。二者均不作股权价差基数。\"}}]}}], \"has_more\": false, \"next_cursor\": null, \"type\": \"block\", \"block\": {}}"
}

